WEBVTT

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.440
<i>The year is 1889.</i>

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.780
<i>Jean and Nadia infiltrated the secret base of a mysterious group</i>

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:37.360
<i>called Neo Atlantis to rescue the imprisoned Marie and King.</i>

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.820
<i>However, they were found, and surrounded by enemy soldiers.</i>

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:44.580
<i>In this crisis, Nadia jumped into the open to save Jean.</i>

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:03.220
It's been a long time. I didn't think we'd be meeting again.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:06.230
I don't know you.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.360
That's understandable. You were still a baby.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.780
Don't you want to know where we met before?

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.370
You're a murderer. I don't know any murderers!

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:25.240
You're stubborn, just like your father was.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.580
Now then...

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.080
Where is the Blue Water?

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.170
I threw it away in the ocean.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.720
Marie! King!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.930
Don't you care what happens to them?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:51.940
I told you I threw it away! I don't have it! Marie is not...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.570
Now, where is the Blue Water?

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:58.990
At the bottom of the ocean!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.250
Marie, don't look!

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:20.760
You and your stubbornness killed that man.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.760
You inhuman beast! Please stop!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.970
You murderer! God will never forgive you for this!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.730
I'll never tell you no matter how many times you ask me!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.650
Let Marie and King go! Set the people of this island free too!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.820
You won't tell me? That means you know.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.410
Such an innocent child.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:52.540
The person who takes this child's life will be you!

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.540
In exchange for the child's life...

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.670
Is the Blue Water worth all that?

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.930
You're going to regret this.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.570
Wait!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.190
Please wait.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.700
Where is the Blue Water?

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.200
The boy...

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.700
The boy who was with me has it.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.710
Thank you.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.680
Forgive me, Jean.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.810
Our target is that kid! Search every hole!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.320
Don't let even a mouse get away!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.450
Nadia must be inside that castle somewhere.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.700
There are soldiers all over the place.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.040
Nadia...

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.220
Please...

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.760
...let us out...

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.350
...of a place like this!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.190
You're going to end up just like those guys.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.240
Just keep crying until you drop dead.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.670
Just kidding!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.170
What do we do now, Miss?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:07.470
Maybe we should take a little time to rest.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:11.970
That's a good idea. All that manual work tired me out.

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.600
My precious hairdo was getting all mussed up.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.270
Let's wait until it gets dark.
We'll get some sleep till then.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.480
Right you are!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.830
What's that?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.940
It's the mine car operation center.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.200
I've got it!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.010
This car will take me straight into the castle.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:45.980
As long as they keep searching, it means you're safe. Jean...

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.110
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:52.110
I've brought you your dinner, Princess.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.740
Princess?

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.450
That is correct.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:01.460
I've been instructed to address you and treat you like a princess.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:04.830
There's no reason to call me a princess.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:09.630
What's more, I'll never eat food prepared by murderers.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:13.840
Your soup is getting cold. Shall I replace it, Princess?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:19.470
What about Marie and King?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.480
They are taking their dinner now.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.350
No! No! No!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:28.610
I'm hungry! I'm hungry! I'M HUNGRY!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.190
Be quiet! Here's your dinner.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.490
It's soup!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:42.870
Hot!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.960
I see.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.440
Man, it hasn't moved a bit!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.690
Gee, I'm hungry.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:17.070
Now then, we've had a nice nap, and it's past our dinner time.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:20.030
I think it's time to leave this hotel.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.450
Couldn't agree more. Just leave it to me!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.960
In this era of modern science,

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:29.290
you're not thinking of using muscles to pry open the bars?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.670
Of course!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:35.420
You're not thinking of picking that lock, are you? That's corny!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:38.640
Oh yeah? Your primitive attitude is cornier!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:43.020
Let me tell you something. My way will get us out of here faster!

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.180
I'll show you!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.980
May I borrow a hairpin, Miss?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.230
Let's see what you can do.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.530
Let's begin!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.250
It's open!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.000
Okay, okay. Let's go.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.860
This isn't good.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.570
With all this activity, it's going to be hard getting out.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.740
Let's get inside this car.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.870
It may take us outside in the morning.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.330
Good idea!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.830
Good idea.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.570
Princess, Lord Gargoyle is waiting for you.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.900
I don't want to go.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.160
The little girl and the baby lion will be there too.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.370
What? Marie and King?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.760
Now King will look pretty too, right?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.260
Marie! King!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.140
Nadia!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.720
Marie!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.520
Nadia!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.810
King!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:59.070
Look, look, Nadia! There are so many flowers here!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.950
Yes, there sure are.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.450
How do you like my garden in the sky?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.330
We are the crystallization of Neo Atlantis science.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:13.830
Science?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:20.590
That's right! We have created all the flowers, trees and grass you see here.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.090
What's more, they will never die.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.100
They will continue to show us their beauty.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:33.890
Our science can already create nature.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:38.730
We have become the creator of all things.
We can even become gods!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.860
That is arrogance.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:48.120
Well, Nadia, don't you want to be with us in this great venture?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.620
Just let us go.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.960
Sorry, but that's impossible.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.300
Marie! King! Let's go!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.460
Stop that.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.840
You'll only get hurt.

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:17.940
I forgot to tell you this garden is enclosed by an invisible wall.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:21.530
It's made of a special glass called textite.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:24.190
You can't go any farther.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.620
The children can play freely in here.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.710
Come with me, Nadia.
I'll show you my base.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.640
It's moving!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.020
Lucky!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:11.120
Over there is the new power plant that supplies the base electricity.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:16.120
With half the plant's output, Paris and London would be bright as day.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:21.380
This great power gives us the power of gods.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.420
Look at this beautiful tower.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.890
It is the Tower of Babel!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.140
The huge power from the plant

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.770
is fed into this tower, and becomes particle energy!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.740
This is the heart of the Tower.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.120
Beautiful!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.290
Within this spiral tower,

00:14:56.290 --> 00:15:01.420
the particle energy is accelerated,
compressed into a central chamber,

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.420
and the light ray is sent into the distant sky.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.510
Then the god's punishment is wreaked.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.760
When the ray returns to Earth,

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.810
it will burn and destroy everything!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:24.570
In the tremendous heat, nothing will be left alive.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:31.910
By directing this ray, we can attack any point on the Earth,

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.910
and destroy it completely!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.490
We can create anything we desire,

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.870
Jean... Jean, where are you?

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.460
That is the power of the gods!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.420
Jean!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.550
Nadia, wait for me! I'll come, and get you out!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.940
A wonderful sight.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:05.980
To think of all the years and months that went into its creation.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.490
I'll treat you to a wonderful sight tonight.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.240
It is a return to Sodom and Gomorrah!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.660
Sodom and Gomorrah?

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:20.500
Yes, as you know, the two cities wiped out by the wrath of God.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.670
Sodom and Gomorrah were wiped out by the Tower of Babel.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:30.380
More accurately, this is a faithful copy of the Tower of Babel.

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:34.720
Tonight, we are going to make our first test of its power.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.430
I don't want to see anything like that.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:41.600
But you must. You are going to give me your full cooperation.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:47.230
No, I'm not! I'll never help you!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:48.770
We'll see about that.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:57.820
It stopped!

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.500
What is this place?

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.630
This doesn't look so good.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.630
Yeah, there are more people now than before.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.380
We can't leave this car.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.470
Let's wait a little longer.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.510
Right.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.060
Watch out! Put it down slowly!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:24.310
If we should put a scratch on it, Lord Gargoyle will kill us!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.980
Yeah, we'd be shark food.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:29.060
Nothing is too good for the precious artificial Orihalcon.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:29.900
Orihalcon?

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:53.420
My comrades, the day we've been waiting for has finally arrived.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:57.930
It is a resurrection of the power of Atlantis!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:12.690
After twelve years and at a huge cost, this plan has been completed.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:19.200
It gives me tremendous pleasure to share the results with you tonight.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:24.160
Without your unsparing cooperation,

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:30.210
the success of this plan could not have been achieved.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.210
I hereby declare,

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:38.220
you are about to witness the miracle of a light from the gods!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.220
The light shall become our power

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.720
to make the world kneel in bondage to Atlantis again.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.890
Neo Atlantis will lead humanity away from their erring ways

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.610
toward the true path.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.030
We shall take the first step tonight!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.740
Now everyone,

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.490
the test will commence!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.920
Sir, the unloading of cargo from Car 14 is not yet finished.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.380
Leave it! Everyone to the truck, on the double!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.880
Yes, Sir!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.900
It got quiet all of a sudden.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.490
Everyone's gone.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.530
Right!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:43.780
Here I go.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.080
Everyone is in their assigned positions, Sir.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.210
Good. Prepare to fire!

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:58.340
Yes, Sir. Preparing to fire!

00:19:58.590 --> 00:19:59.590
Power switch off.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.090
Sir!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.380
Power switch off!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.440
What is this? What happened?

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:15.610
Commence power flow.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.690
Commencing power flow!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:25.070
This is the Control Room.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.540
All circuits will be rerouted to direct power to the Tower of Babel.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:31.540
All circuits from one to sixteen have been connected.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:41.420
What is this?

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.340
Have they found us?

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.800
Feed power to all systems.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.850
Power flowing to all systems.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.520
What's going on?

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:54.850
It looks just like the Blue Water gem.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.020
Artificial Orihalcon in operation. All circuitry, check.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.820
Inflow of electrical energy normal.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.780
Particle accelerator, initiating.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.620
Pressure inside the particle accelerator is rising.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.830
Pressure normal.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.300
My hair! My hair!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.220
Voltage increased to second stage.

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.800
Transmission to slave star Michael now commencing.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.560
Transmission from slave star Michael has been confirmed.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.940
No doubt about it. It is a legacy left by Atlantis.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:44.490
It has been flying in space these 12,000 years waiting for us!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.490
Test target, the island of Balkenya.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.620
Online directional finder now operating.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:02.420
Captain Nemo, high energy output detected at two o'clock.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.920
It's unbelievably strong.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.380
Can it be the Tower of Babel?

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:11.890
All systems fully operational.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.600
Disengage all safety systems.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.190
Fire controls have locked in on the target.

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.320
Tolerance adjustment of reflection angle completed.

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:27.530
Auto-rotation tracking system in order.

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:29.610
Final safety systems have been disengaged.

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.330
Thirty seconds to reach critical pressure point.

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:33.790
Turned to maximum voltage!

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:39.460
Twenty seconds to firing.

00:22:39.460 --> 00:22:43.550
Wear dark safety glasses as precautions against glare.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:46.300
Ten seconds to firing.

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:47.130
8...

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:48.300
7...

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:49.090
6...

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:50.300
5...

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:51.090
4...

00:22:51.090 --> 00:22:52.300
3...

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:53.140
2...

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.220
1...

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:30.840
Of all things, Gargoyle has completed his Tower of Babel.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:33.260
It's glorious!

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:39.520
It is the light of the gods. The world will once again kneel to us.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:44.360
It is the light of Satan. It can destroy this world again.
